{
  "name": "Missed-Call AI Text-Back (Lead Recovery)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Missed-call AI text-back\nFlow A: Twilio call status webhook. If the call was not answered, text the caller back within seconds and log the lead.\nFlow B: Twilio inbound SMS webhook. An LLM qualifies the reply (service, urgency), every lead gets a reply with the booking link, urgent leads also trigger an owner SMS alert, and every reply is logged to the CRM sheet.\n\nSetup: set BUSINESS_NAME, BOOKING_URL and OWNER_PHONE in the Config nodes, connect Twilio, Google Sheets and an OpenAI header credential, then point your Twilio number's status callback to /missed-call and its messaging webhook to /sms-reply.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "d800b997-df04-4c38-8c64-28c8ec2f9d62",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -380
      ]
    },
